        "id": "DariusHemoMarker",
        "name": "Hemorrhage",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Darius' attacks and damaging abilities cause enemies to bleed for physical damage over 5 seconds, stacking up to 5 times. Darius enrages and gains massive Attack Damage when his target reaches max stacks.",
        "bodyHtml": "Darius' Attacks and damaging Abilities cause the target to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hemorrhage</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((13 ~ 30) + ([[si:scalead]]30% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> over 5 seconds, stacking up to 5 times.<br /><br />When an enemy reaches max stacks or is killed by <span>Noxian Guillotine</span>, Darius gains an additional <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-500\">(30 ~ 185) Attack Damage</span> and applies 5 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hemorrhage</span> stacks on all Attack or damaging Ability hits for 5 seconds.",
