        "id": "DariusCleave",
        "name": "Decimate",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Darius winds up and swings his axe in a wide circle. Enemies struck by the blade take more damage than those struck by the handle. Darius heals based on enemy champions and large monsters hit by the blade.",
        "bodyHtml": "Darius hefts his axe then swings it around, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50/80/110/140/170 + ([[si:scalead]]100/110/120/130/140% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> with the edge and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(17.5/28/38.5/49/59.5 + (35/38.5/42/45.5/49% Attack Damage)) damage</span> with the handle. Enemies hit with the handle do not take a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hemorrhage</span> stack.<br /><br />Darius restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">17% missing Health</span> per enemy champion and large jungle monster hit with the edge, up to a max of <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">51%</span>.",
