        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Darius leaps to an enemy champion and strikes a lethal blow, dealing true damage. This damage is increased for each stack of Hemorrhage on the target. If Noxian Guillotine is a killing blow, its cooldown is refreshed for a brief duration.",
        "bodyHtml": "Darius leaps to an enemy and strikes a lethal blow, dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(125/250/375 + ([[si:scalead]]75% bonus Attack Damage)) true damage</span>. For each <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hemorrhage</span> on the target, this Ability deals an additional 20% damage, up to a max of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(250/500/750 + (150% bonus Attack Damage)) damage</span>.<br /><br />If this kills the target, Darius may <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability once within 20 seconds. At rank 3, this Ability has no Mana cost and kills refresh the Cooldown completely.",
